A?p=preview\n\nIf you open the console, you will see `created [NameComponent]` for each link you click on *except* the 'whatever' link which lazily loads the `AnythingModule`.\n\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\n\nMore flexible routing setups.\n\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\n\nMac os Sierra\n\n* **Angular version:** 2.0.X\n\nAngular `2.4.0`, Router: `3.4.1`\n\n* **Browser:** [all | Chrome XX | Firefox XX | IE XX | Safari XX | Mobile Chrome XX | Android X.X Web Browser | iOS XX Safari | iOS XX UIWebView | iOS XX WKWebView ]\n\nAll\n \n* **Language:** [all | TypeScript X.X | ES6/7 | ES5]\n\nTypeScript\n\n* **Node (for AoT issues):** `node --version` =   \n\nNode `6.9.1`, npm `3.10.1`\n\n/cc @zoechi since he had helped initially with the SO post. Thank you!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13848/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13848/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/529958706","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/12955#issuecomment-529958706","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/12955","id":529958706,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyOTk1ODcwNg==","user":{"login":"angular-automatic-lock-bot[bot]","id":54863671,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTQ4NjM2NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/40213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/angular-automatic-lock-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/othe